---
import ExternalBrandMark from '../common/ExternalBrandMark';
import { type Locale } from '../../i18n';
interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => locale === 'zh' ? cn : en;
const goalCodeUrl = 'https://github.com/princeton-nlp/WebShop/blob/master/web_agent_site/engine/goal.py';
const envCodeUrl = 'https://github.com/princeton-nlp/WebShop/blob/master/web_agent_site/envs/web_agent_text_env.py';
const readmeUrl = 'https://github.com/princeton-nlp/WebShop#webpage-environment-html-mode';
const sizes = ['8', '9', '10'] as const;
const colors = ['Black', 'Blue'] as const;
---
<section id="fig-webshop-goal-generation" class="canonical-figure webshop-goal-generation" aria-labelledby="webshop-goal-generation-title" data-ui-audit="contrast layout overflow">
  <header class="figure-header">
    <div class="figure-label">{t('第三步 · GOAL GENERATION', 'STEP 3 · GOAL GENERATION')}</div>
    <h3 id="webshop-goal-generation-title">{t('Small WebShop：1,000 个商品生成 6,910 个可执行 goals', 'Small WebShop: 1,000 products generate 6,910 executable goals')}</h3>
    <p>{t('商品是一条货架记录，goal 是一道“帮我买到符合这些条件的商品”的题目。WebShop 会组合商品已有选项，形成不同购买要求；这一步叫生成（generate），不是把人工指令过滤一遍。', 'A product is one catalog record; a goal is a shopping request. WebShop can combine available product options into distinct requests. This is generation, not filtering human instructions.')}</p>
  </header>
  <figure class="generation-story" aria-labelledby="webshop-goal-generation-title">
    <div class="quantity-line" role="group" aria-label={t('商品目录与合成任务数量', 'Product records and generated goals')}>
      <div><span>{t('官方 small 商品目录', 'OFFICIAL SMALL CATALOG')}</span><strong>1,000</strong><small>{t('件商品', 'products')}</small></div>
      <p>{t('根据商品的颜色、尺码、属性等，生成多个购物要求', 'Generate shopping requests from product options and attributes')}</p>
      <div><span>{t('运行环境产生的题目', 'GENERATED GOALS')}</span><strong>6,910</strong><small>synthetic goals</small></div>
    </div>

    <div class="variant-example">
      <div class="variant-example__intro">
        <span>{t('一个具体的组合例子 · 示意', 'ILLUSTRATIVE PRODUCT EXAMPLE')}</span>
        <p>{t('假设一双鞋只有两种颜色、三个尺码。每个格子对应一种可以写进购物要求里的选择；所有格子都来自同一件商品的选项。', 'Imagine one shoe offered in two colors and three sizes. Each cell is one possible option combination for a shopping request, all drawn from the same product.')}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="variant-table-wrap" role="region" tabindex="0" aria-label={t('颜色和尺码的六种组合', 'Six color-size combinations')}>
        <table class="variant-table">
          <caption>{t('可选颜色 × 可选尺码（教学示意）', 'Available colors × sizes (illustrative)')}</caption>
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">{t('颜色 / 尺码', 'Color / size')}</th>{sizes.map((size) => <th scope="col">{size}</th>)}</tr></thead>
          <tbody>{colors.map((color) => <tr><th scope="row">{color}</th>{sizes.map((size) => <td>{color} · {size}</td>)}</tr>)}</tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="combination-note"><strong>{t('2 种颜色 × 3 个尺码 = 6 种组合', '2 colors × 3 sizes = 6 combinations')}</strong>{t('。它表示同一商品的六种选项组合，不是六次点击，也不是每件商品都会恰好生成六个 goal。', '. These are option combinations for one product, not six clicks and not a universal six-goal-per-product rule.')}</p>
    </div>

    <aside class="unit-boundary" role="note">
      <span class="unit-kicker">两组数字的统计对象不同</span>
      <strong>{t('12,087 条人工指令不是 6,910 个 synthetic goals 的过滤来源', '12,087 human instructions are not the source list filtered into 6,910 goals')}</strong>
      <p>{t('12,087 条来自原始 WebShop 众包人工指令；6,910 条来自 small 环境里 1,000 件商品的 synthetic goal generation。两个数字数的是不同对象。', 'The 12,087 instructions come from original WebShop crowd-sourcing; 6,910 goals are generated from the 1,000-product small environment. The counts refer to different objects.')}</p>
    </aside>

    <details class="evidence">
      <summary>{t('查看任务生成代码与数量证据', 'Inspect source code for task generation and counts')}</summary>
      <div class="evidence-grid">
        <div>
          <strong>goal.py · get_synthetic_goals(...)</strong>
          <code>itertools.product(...)</code>
          <p>{t('代码枚举同一个商品不同 option 的组合，再为组合构造 goal。', 'The code enumerates combinations of each product’s options before constructing goals.')}</p>
          <a href={goalCodeUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={goalCodeUrl} />{t('官方 goal.py ↗', 'Official goal.py ↗')}</a>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong>web_agent_text_env.py</strong>
          <code>human_goals=0 → get_goals(...)</code>
          <p>{t('默认环境使用 synthetic goals；goal 次序按环境代码里的随机种子处理。', 'The default environment uses synthetic goals; their order is set by the environment implementation.')}</p>
          <a href={envCodeUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={envCodeUrl} />{t('官方环境源码 ↗', 'Official environment code ↗')}</a>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong>WebShop README</strong>
          <code>Loaded 6910 goals.</code>
          <p>{t('官方 small 模式运行示例输出 6,910 个可执行 goals。', 'The official small-mode example logs 6,910 loaded goals.')}</p>
          <a href={readmeUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={readmeUrl} />{t('官方 README ↗', 'Official README ↗')}</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </details>
    <figcaption>{t('1,000 件商品对应 6,910 个合成购物任务；颜色 × 尺码的 2 × 3 = 6 只是解释组合逻辑的示意，不是整个数据集的乘法公式。', '1,000 products yield 6,910 synthetic shopping goals. The 2 × 3 = 6 example only illustrates option combinations, not a multiplication formula for the whole dataset.')}</figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>
<style>
  .webshop-goal-generation{width:min(1120px,calc(100% - 2rem));margin:2.2rem auto;padding:clamp(1rem,3vw,2rem);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;background:var(--surface)}
  .figure-header{max-width:930px}.figure-label{color:var(--accent);font:var(--type-weight-medium) var(--type-meta)/var(--type-leading-heading) var(--font-interface);letter-spacing:.1em}.figure-header h2{margin:.42rem 0 .65rem;font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3.7vw,2.9rem);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.045em}.figure-header p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:var(--type-leading-body)}
  .generation-story{margin:1.5rem 0 0}.macro-flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(230px,.7fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:1rem;align-items:stretch}.macro-node{padding:1.1rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:var(--surface-muted);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;min-height:220px}.macro-node small{color:var(--muted);font:800 .6rem/1.2 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.08em}.macro-node strong{display:block;margin:.65rem 0 .12rem;font-size:clamp(2.3rem,5vw,4.6rem);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:-.06em}.macro-node span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.76rem}.macro-node.products{border-top:5px solid var(--line-strong,var(--line))}.macro-node.goals{border-top:5px solid var(--accent)}
  .generator{position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center}.generator-arrow{position:absolute;left:-.35rem;right:-.35rem;top:50%;height:2px;background:var(--accent)}.generator-arrow::after{content:'';position:absolute;right:-2px;top:50%;border:7px solid transparent;border-left-color:var(--accent);transform:translateY(-50%)}.generator-card{position:relative;z-index:1;width:100%;padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--accent);border-radius:12px;background:var(--surface);text-align:center}.generator-card small,.generator-card span{display:block}.generator-card small{color:var(--accent);font:800 .58rem/1.2 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace}.generator-card strong{display:block;margin:.28rem 0 .65rem;font-size:1rem}.generator-card code{display:block;padding:.5rem;border-radius:7px;background:var(--surface-muted);font-size:.68rem;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.generator-card span{margin-top:.55rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:.68rem;line-height:1.45}.generator-card a{display:inline-block;margin-top:.7rem;color:#1467d2;font-size:.68rem;font-weight:800;text-underline-offset:3px}
  .one-product-example{margin-top:1rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:var(--surface)}.one-product-example summary{cursor:pointer;padding:1rem 1.1rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;gap:.45rem .8rem}.one-product-example summary span{color:var(--accent);font-size:.7rem;font-weight:800}.one-product-example summary strong{font-size:.95rem}.example-flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.05fr) 150px minmax(0,1.35fr);gap:1rem;padding:0 1rem 1rem;align-items:center}.product-record{padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:var(--surface-muted)}.example-label{color:var(--muted);font:800 .58rem/1.2 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.06em}.product-record>strong{display:block;margin:.4rem 0 .8rem;font-size:.9rem}.product-record dl{display:grid;gap:.45rem;margin:0}.product-record dl div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:95px 1fr;gap:.5rem;padding-top:.45rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.product-record dt{color:var(--muted);font-size:.66rem}.product-record dd{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.3rem;margin:0;font-size:.7rem}.product-record dd span{padding:.18rem .38rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;background:var(--surface)}.product-record p{margin:.75rem 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.64rem;line-height:1.5}
  .combiner{text-align:center}.combiner code{display:block;color:var(--accent);font-weight:800}.combiner strong{display:block;margin:.25rem 0;font-size:1.5rem}.combiner span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.64rem}.goal-fan{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.45rem}.goal-card{padding:.65rem .7rem;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 38%,var(--line));border-radius:9px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 5%,var(--surface))}.goal-card span{display:block;color:var(--accent);font:800 .56rem/1.2 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace}.goal-card strong{display:block;margin-top:.2rem;font-size:.72rem}
  .unit-boundary{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(250px,.65fr);gap:1rem;align-items:center;margin-top:1rem;padding:1rem;border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:var(--surface)}.boundary-copy small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font:800 .58rem/1.2 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.06em}.boundary-copy strong{display:block;margin:.28rem 0 .35rem;font-size:.86rem}.boundary-copy p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.74rem;line-height:1.55}.boundary-equation{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;gap:.5rem;align-items:center}.boundary-equation>strong{font-size:1.4rem;color:var(--muted)}.boundary-equation span{padding:.65rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;background:var(--surface-muted);text-align:center;font-size:.6rem;color:var(--muted)}.boundary-equation b{display:block;margin-bottom:.15rem;color:var(--ink);font-size:1rem}
  .evidence{margin-top:1rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--surface)}.evidence summary{cursor:pointer;padding:.85rem 1rem;font-weight:var(--type-weight-heading);font-size:var(--type-meta)}.evidence-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.7rem;padding:0 1rem 1rem}.evidence-grid article{padding:.8rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:var(--surface-muted)}.evidence-grid small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font:800 .56rem/1.2 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace}.evidence-grid code{display:block;margin:.45rem 0;padding:.5rem;border-radius:6px;background:var(--surface);font-size:var(--type-meta);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.evidence-grid p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:var(--type-body-small);line-height:var(--type-leading-body)}.evidence-grid a{display:inline-block;margin-top:.55rem;color:#1467d2;font-size:var(--type-meta);font-weight:var(--type-weight-heading)}.generation-story figcaption{margin-top:.85rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:var(--type-caption);line-height:var(--type-leading-caption)}
  @media(max-width:860px){.macro-flow,.example-flow,.unit-boundary{grid-template-columns:1fr}.generator{min-height:155px}.generator-arrow{left:50%;right:auto;top:-.25rem;bottom:-.25rem;width:2px;height:auto;transform:translateX(-50%)}.generator-arrow::after{right:auto;left:50%;top:auto;bottom:-8px;transform:translateX(-50%);border:7px solid transparent;border-top-color:var(--accent)}.combiner{padding:.45rem 0}.goal-fan{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.evidence-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  @media(max-width:560px){.webshop-goal-generation{width:min(100% - 1rem,1120px);padding:1rem}.goal-fan,.boundary-equation{grid-template-columns:1fr}.boundary-equation>strong{text-align:center}.product-record dl div{grid-template-columns:1fr}.one-product-example summary{display:block}.one-product-example summary strong{display:block;margin-top:.28rem}}

@container article-figure (max-width:860px){.macro-flow,.example-flow,.unit-boundary{grid-template-columns:1fr}.generator{min-height:155px}.generator-arrow{left:50%;right:auto;top:-.25rem;bottom:-.25rem;width:2px;height:auto;transform:translateX(-50%)}.generator-arrow::after{right:auto;left:50%;top:auto;bottom:-8px;transform:translateX(-50%);border:7px solid transparent;border-top-color:var(--accent)}.combiner{padding:.45rem 0}.goal-fan{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.evidence-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
@container article-figure (max-width:560px){.webshop-goal-generation{width:min(100% - 1rem,1120px);padding:1rem}.goal-fan,.boundary-equation{grid-template-columns:1fr}.boundary-equation>strong{text-align:center}.product-record dl div{grid-template-columns:1fr}.one-product-example summary{display:block}.one-product-example summary strong{display:block;margin-top:.28rem}}
</style>
